Package: noder
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: ARCH_PLACEHOLDER
Maintainer: Ryu <wel@ryugo.org>
Depends: systemd, ca-certificates
Provides: sub-server
Replaces: sub-server
Description: Fast, lightweight Sing-Box and Mihomo subscription aggregator and node manager.
 Noder is a high-performance web dashboard and subscription middleman service
 for managing Sing-Box nodes, routing rules, users and subscriptions.
 Built with Go and Vue3 as a single-binary distribution.
